## Original Content
ПАО "Нижнекамскнефтехим" (НКНХ, входит в "СИБУР") в январе-июне 2026 года признало убыток от обесценения активов в размере 1,5 млрд рублей, говорится в отчетности компании по МСФО.

## Summary
Nizhnekamskneftekhim, part of the SIBUR group, reported a loss of 1.5 billion rubles from asset impairment for January to June 2026 according to IFRS reporting. This financial disclosure highlights the company's recent performance challenges in the petrochemical sector.

## Key Points
- The company recognized a loss of 1.5 billion rubles.
- The loss was attributed to asset impairment.
- The reporting period was the first half of 2026.
- Financial statements were prepared under IFRS standards.


